'''test'''<sup>1</sup> (test), ''v. t.'' [< ''test''<sup>1</sup>, ''n.''] 1. In ''metal.'', to refine, as gold or silver, by means of lead, in a test, by the removal by scorification of all extraneous matter, or in some other way.

{{smaller block|Not with fond shekels of the ''tested'' gold.
{{right|''Shak.'', M. for M., ii. 2. 149.}}}}

